'''Kid Tappa''' (マナブくん ''Manabu-kun'') is a [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]] variant of [[Dolphina]] that appears in [[Cats of the Cosmos]], [[Legend Stages]] and [[The Aku Realms]]. He was added in [[Version 7.2 Update|Version 7.2]].

